			"size": [
				520.0,
				250.0
			],
			"text": "07 — Physics: Forces & Properties\n\nTests advanced RigidBodyCOMP features:\n• Green cylinder: CHOP-driven upward force (fights gravity)\n• Yellow sphere: initial velocity (launched sideways)\n• Orange box: zero gravity + axis-lock rotation to Z only\n• Purple torus: high bounce (0.95) + CCD enabled\n\nAll objects interact with a static ground plane.\nConstantCHOP → force_in on the green cylinder provides\ncontinuous upward thrust.",
			"type": "note"
		}
	],
